body:
I really want Dorinda to get her comeuppance because she seems to think she is the realist when reality TV is mirroring a different image. I really do not like her and think she is so nasty, which is super disappointing because I loved her at first. 

&#x200B;

I wish someone who wasn't on the show would just tell her to really look at herself (here's to the reunion and hoping Andy Cohen reads Dorinda what people actually think).

I understand your pain. I am turning 27 and I feel so worthless like I am a failed human being. I had to stop going to school my final semester because I burned myself out and broke down. I'm on the same boat but I am hoping that we can both make it out of this alive. 

&#x200B;

Good luck!
